  "notes": "Cash basis county. Statement lines from Exhibit D Total Governmental Funds column (p4); roll-forward 3,382,060 + 1,831,427 - 2,520,222 + 361,335 - 361,335 = 2,693,265 ties. Beginning cash is not printed (only beginning fund balance and net position), so beginning_cash is null; ending cash 2,693,265 from Equity in Pooled Cash (Balance Sheet p3). Balance sheet from the governmental funds Balance Sheet - Cash Basis (p3), whose totals equal the Statement of Net Position (p1). Detail: General Fund (Exhibit F pp5-6), Road Fund (Exhibit G p7), Inheritance Tax (Exhibit H p8) budget schedules; Building debt service fund from Schedule 2 (p9); nonmajor special revenue funds from the Schedule 4 combining pages (pp10-11), more detailed than the Schedule 5 budget totals (pp12-13), which are not recorded to avoid double counting. General Fund Taxes 899,474 (p5, final budget 898,363) split into Property Taxes 851,933 and Motor Vehicle Tax 47,541 using the General column of Exhibit D (p4). Veteran's Aid and Drug Law Enforcement funds had no activity. Transfers tie: General out 346,335 = Road 260,000 + Inheritance 60,000 + Extension 22,558 + Bookmobile 3,777; Bookmobile out 15,000 = Library in. Read pages 1-13 of 13."
